  "docs": {
    "description": "Brief contextual label shown on hover or keyboard focus. Size sm for icon-button labels; md for multi-word descriptions. Position top is default; use right/bottom/left only when top would clip the viewport. Max 1 line (sm) or ~10 words (md). Show after ~500ms hover delay. Never trap focus or hold interactive content — use Popover for that. Pair with aria-describedby on the trigger element.",
    "figmaIssues": []
  },
